{"entity_id":"item.monomate","entity_type":"item","canonical_name":"Monomate / 单体药","language":"zh","aliases":["Monomate","单体药","小回复药"],"description_short":"Monomate 是基础回复道具，早期用于补足治疗 Technique 不够或行动来不及时的空档。","description_long":"新手可以让前排和速度稳定的角色各带一些。不要把所有回复都交给一个会治疗的角色，以免回合顺序不够安全。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"none","source_refs":["ps4.community_wiki","ps4.localized_name_audit","ps4.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.ps4.monomate.zh","language":"zh","intent":"usage","question_patterns":["单体药有什么用","小回复药要买吗"],"answer":"Monomate 是基础回复道具，早期很实用。让几个角色都带一点，能补上治疗 Technique 来不及的回合。","source_refs":["ps4.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"none"}]}
{"entity_id":"item.dimate","entity_type":"item","canonical_name":"Dimate / 中级药","language":"zh","aliases":["Dimate","中级药"],"description_short":"Dimate 是更强的回复道具，适合迷宫深处或 Boss 战前后使用。","description_long":"当普通回复药开始不够用时，说明敌人伤害进入新阶段。补给时升级回复道具，通常比硬省钱更稳。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"none","source_refs":["ps4.community_wiki","ps4.localized_name_audit","ps4.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.ps4.dimate.zh","language":"zh","intent":"usage","question_patterns":["中级药要买吗","Dimate 有什么用"],"answer":"Dimate 是比基础药更强的回复道具。迷宫变长或 Boss 前可以买一些，别为了省钱让队伍残血硬撑。","source_refs":["ps4.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"none"}]}
