{"entity_id":"item.escapipe","entity_type":"item","canonical_name":"Escapipe / 逃脱管","language":"zh","aliases":["Escapipe","逃脱管","逃离管"],"description_short":"Escapipe 是离开迷宫用的便利道具，适合资源见底或走错深处时保命。","description_long":"它不是战斗强度道具，而是风险控制。迷宫探索前带一个，能减少迷路、TP 空了或补给不足导致的损失。","progress_gate":"early_game","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["ps4.community_wiki","ps4.localized_name_audit","ps4.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.ps4.escapipe.zh","language":"zh","intent":"usage","question_patterns":["逃脱管有什么用","迷宫怎么出去","Escapipe 是什么"],"answer":"逃脱管用于离开迷宫，适合迷路、TP 见底或补给不足时保命。探索前带一个会安心很多。","source_refs":["ps4.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
